<p>One big problem; the box art contains Non-Commercial license image (<a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/frances__ann__blair/225410788">haunted house illustration</a>), which is <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-7519019/use-of-creative-commons-material#post-3972945">not available on SCP wiki</a>. I strongly recommend that you fix current image &#8212; if the box art gets omitted, your above-mentioned spoilers would not work well. Moreover, this art is too good to be entirely thrown away.</p>

